{"overview":"وقتی کلئو قدرت فوق‌العاده‌ای جدید و مخرب پیدا می‌کند، لیگ قهرمانان او را به مدرسه‌ی برتر برای قهرمانان می‌فرستد تا کنترل مهارت‌هایش را بیاموزد. با چشم‌انداز فرستادن کلئو برای سال‌ها، خانواده‌ی تاندرمان‌ها به دو گروه تقسیم می‌شوند؛ فِیبی، بارب و بیلی او را مخفی می‌سازند، در حالی که مکس، هانک و نُرای اعضای گمشده‌ی خانواده را دنبال می‌کنند؛ تا در نهایت دو گروه در نبردی کامل برای آینده‌ی تاندرمان‌ها به هم می‌رسند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"When Chloe develops a destructive new superpower, the Hero League orders her to an elite boarding school for superheroes to learn control of her abilities. Faced with the prospect of sending Chloe away for years, the Thundermans split apart, with Phoebe, Barb and Billy taking her into hiding. Max, Hank, and Nora track their rogue family members, until the two factions face off against each other in a full-on battle for the Thundermans’ future.","tagline_en":"This changes everything.","runtime":72,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Trevor Kirschner"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["CA","US"],"cast":[{"name":"کیرا کوسارین","role":"Phoebe Thunderman","photo":"/rWshWHUPTlw3zIsgzXe3oo94mDP.jpg","en":"Kira Kosarin"},{"name":"Jack Griffo","role":"Max Thunderman","photo":"/tPXgQ7FRoN2SOxkDncLOjwSiPdH.jpg"},{"name":"Maya Le Clark","role":"Chloe Thunderman","photo":"/5FVWT2mKZYWk7dDmL9KGURwY3Bb.jpg"},{"name":"Rosa Blasi","role":"Barb Thunderman","photo":"/lhRsVoOXAx0bwn6eJcx38njZEMS.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Tallman","role":"Hank Thunderman","photo":"/7ft585219p5A3HdYFLyM3Dxawi1.jpg"},{"name":"Diego Velazquez","role":"Billy Thunderman","photo":"/sYfMqj0BO6y5fNB80AAbKOfbMTR.jpg"},{"name":"Addison Riecke","role":"Nora Thunderman","photo":"/bLZDfktybcMbC2qp46G9LJ5L1UX.jpg"},{"name":"Daniele Gaither","role":"President Kickbutt","photo":"/jkQwV1jOwCCI5uTe99dS4ZfYc9p.jpg"},{"name":"آریل وینتر","role":"Cognita","photo":"/1h0XaXnieP5CdTAeRGuALBJmD4R.jpg","en":"Ariel Winter"},{"name":"Dana Snyder","role":"Dr. Colosso (voice)